og-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">然而……</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">宝可梦中心札幌店的</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">休息室完全超出了我的期待！</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/001-ad8eddf6c0.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/001-ad8eddf6c0.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n欢迎板也做得好可爱！\n宝芬盒里面\n塞满了满满的点心！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/002-2a0c28b5ad.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/002-2a0c28b5ad.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n树果背面还有\n工作人员写的留言！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/003-b93729a026.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/003-b93729a026.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n看起来像主角的人\n被可达鸭挡住了去路！\n“可达鸭们  一直  待在那里\n不管做什么  看起来都不会动”\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/004-31580d7f86.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/004-31580d7f86.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n竹兰“对可达鸭们\n使用这个  说不定会好哦”\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n在某个地方见过的活动（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n他们利用休息室的边桌\n把这个活动重现出来了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/005-b9cf2ae389.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/005-b9cf2ae389.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n太厉害了！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/006-967b92d859.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/006-967b92d859.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"914\"></a></figure>\n\n居然这么大！好大！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n看起来像主角的人原来是增田！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/007-1ea0bbe325.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/007-1ea0bbe325.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n宝可梦棋盘大师风格的台座（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n另外\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n在4只可达鸭的后面\n看得出来吗？\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/008-0cd138f0d5.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/008-0cd138f0d5.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n就在这儿！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/009-041666fdb6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/009-041666fdb6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n这个\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n会动的！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/010-c4beedb101.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/010-c4beedb101.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n里面那一块是显示器\n宝可梦们\n偶尔会从里面跳出来（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n真是讲究到不得了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n旁边还有图鉴！\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/011-89c88c3ec6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/011-89c88c3ec6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"621\" height=\"840\"></a></figure>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n最后的签名会\n就这样\n在绝妙的创意中\n落下了帷幕！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n宝可梦中心札幌店的\n各位工作人员\n真的非常感谢你们！\n我太感动了！\n\n<br>\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n下回再见啦！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<br></div>","markdown_ja":"<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">今回の</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ポケモンセンターサイン会</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">どこの</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">ポケモンセンターに行っても</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">控室が凝っていて・・・</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">こうなってくると</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">期待してないといったら</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\">嘘になる（笑）</div>\n<div class=\"gf-lineblog-line gf-lineblog-line--center\"><br></div>\n<div class=