gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/004-31580d7f86.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\nシロナ「コダックたちに\nこれを  つかうと  いいかもよ」\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nどこかで見たイベント（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n控室のサイドテーブルを使って\nイベントを再現してくれてました！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/005-b9cf2ae389.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/005-b9cf2ae389.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n凄すぎる！！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/006-967b92d859.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/006-967b92d859.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"914\"></a></figure>\n\nこんな大きさ！デカイ！\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n主人公らしき人はマスダだった！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/007-1ea0bbe325.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/007-1ea0bbe325.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"639\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\nポケモンコマスター的な台座（笑）\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nさらに\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nコダック4匹の奥\n分かるかな？\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/008-0cd138f0d5.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/008-0cd138f0d5.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"852\"></a></figure>\n\n\n\n<br>\n\n\nここんところ！\n\n\n<figure class=\"gf-lineblog-image\"><a href=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/009-041666fdb6.webp\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"/assets/images/gamefreak-lineblog/3921825/009-041666fdb6.webp\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1136\" height=\"85